The v0-style Prototype for To-handoff's swap test (#125): a Next.js 15 App
Router app with shadcn/ui (style radix-nova), a server page that renders a
client "Request access" form with loading, error and success states, a
SubmitButton that forwards its props to Button, Button asChild around a Link, a
portaled Select and a sonner toast. Source plus its package-lock.json; the
static tests never install it.

Origin: copied unchanged from prototypes/source-link/v0-app/ on branch
prototype/source-link, commit c2b4f98ef087ba5af4b4f32f0edcbf6da713ce7f, the same
project skills/adapter-generic/fixtures/radix-nova was copied from. Added:
decisions.json, this run's fixed answers. Left out: its create-next-app README,
favicon and public/ images.

